Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.40,0:00:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\fs120\pos(981,344)}Firefly Wedding {\c&H00D7FF&\fs120}Extra
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.90,0:00:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\fs100\pos(938,762)}Unfit to Be a Bodyguard
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.32,0:00:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s been so long since I last went into town. 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.62,0:00:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting carried away! 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.60,0:00:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotaro, are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.16,0:00:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.40,0:00:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What is all that luggage?   
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.60,0:00:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to explain.   
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.12,0:00:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,First, in case it rains, your parasol is too small, \Nso I brought a larger umbrella.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.12,0:00:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, medicine and drinks in case you feel unwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.10,0:00:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Furthermore, I had the maid prepare a change of clothes \Nso you won't catch a cold if you sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.16,0:00:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Err...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.28,0:00:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,In that event, we can't have you sleeping on a hard floor, \Nso I brought a futon for that occasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.79,0:00:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And considering the possibility of an extended stay, \NI also brought your favorite pillow and blanket...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.88,0:00:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave them behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.16,0:00:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.84,0:00:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Just leave them!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.60,0:00:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The town center really is lively and wonderful, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.76,0:01:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Please let me know if you feel unwell. 
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.40,0:01:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I will carry you back on my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.50,0:01:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,EH?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.36,0:01:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"On my back..." 
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.66,0:01:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}'Lady Satoko, please endure it a little longer.'
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.64,0:01:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes, Kotaro, you're the only one I can rely on.'
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.92,0:01:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How improper of me! 
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.40,0:01:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I am completely unfit to be a bodyguard!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.88,0:01:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Kotaro is acting strange...
